    <td width="24%" valign="top" style="width:24.62%;padding:2.9pt 2.9pt 2.9pt 2.9pt"><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style="font-variant:small-caps">Dissenting Reasons:</span></b><span style="font-variant:small-caps"> </span></p> <p class="MsoNormal">(paras.&nbsp;62 to 131)</p></td>
